OL,3,GNEWSAInmates in court over attack on
OL,4,ASara Sharif's father
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo prisoners have appeared in court
OL,7,Faccused of attempting to murder Urfan
OL,8,FSharif, who was jailed for killing his
OL,9,F10-year-old daughter Sara Sharif.
OL,11,FSteven Sansom, 47, and Adam Watson, 39,
OL,12,Fwere charged earlier this month
OL,13,Ffollowing an incident in Belmarsh
OL,14,FPrison on 1 January 2025, which
OL,15,Freportedly left Sharif with cuts to his
OL,16,Fface.
OL,18,FUrfan Sharif and Sara's stepmother,
OL,19,FBeinash Batool, were sentenced to life
OL,20,Fimprisonment for murdering Sara at
OL,21,Ftheir family home in Woking, Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
